<title>CANADA: Canadian dollar ends flat ahead of U.S. data.</title>
<headline>Canadian dollar ends flat ahead of U.S. data.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3935/1.3975	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3966</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3930   SUPPORT 1.4000	HI 1.3975   LO  1.3995</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3960/65    HI 1.3987     EUROPE OPEN     1.3964</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3975/80    LO 1.3957     HI 1.3968   LO  1.3957</p>
<p>----------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* The Canadian dollar ended flat at C$1.3975 (US$0.7155) on Wednesday from Tuesday's close in thin trading ahead of U.S. economic data due out on Thursday and Friday, traders said. * They said the currency gave back earlier gains on the day after minor interest to sell U.S. dollars for Canadian dollars faded ahead of U.S. jobless claims and payroll numbers.</p>
